{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(this is for when you do identify it:\n```Mending Blunderbuss\nThe crator of this firearm spent weeks working on this one of a kind gun. It has runes and sigils eteched into every part of it, along with a triangular emblem on the grip.\n\nCan only be attuned by a Spellcaster\nMagic Weapon\nAttack Type: Ranged\nRange: 15 ft Cone\nDamage: 2d8\nDamage Type: Piercing\nWeight: 3lb.\n\nProperties:\nAmmunition (Firearms), Range\n\nThis is a +2 magic weapon, even if used by someone not attuned to it.\n\nWhen firing this weapon, roll the ranged weapon attack as normal.  Compare the result vs the AC of everything in a 15 ft cone orriginating from the firearm as small pellets are sprayed out.  Each target that has an AC equal to or greater than the attack roll is unharmed, everything else in the area takes full damage.\n\nThis gun takes 1 minute to reload.  It can be fired 1 time before needing reloaded.\n\nIf a spellcaster is attuned, they may use their spellcasting modifier for the attacks instead of Dex.  In addition it has the following property:\nThe user may use their action to make a ranged weapon attack with the blunderbus as per the description above, consuming the ammo, and a spell slot.  In addition to the above effect, the damage from the attack increases by 1d10 per spell level consumed.  Then you fire the weapon you may choose for the damage to be converted into healing, or one of the following elements: Cold, Fire, Thunder, or Lightning.  If the attack misses but still hits AC 10, the attack does half of the damage (or healing).```\n)","created_at":"2021-08-20T13:42:41.439000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878272835229982781","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
