{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he nods \"We mostly keep to the waters of our birth.... or near them.... so not many of us travel.  I only left home when it was taken away from us for instance\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:30:10.000000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878314981949591623","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Ah, I see, I'm more of the traveling type.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:31:17.180000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878315263722930247","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"What is the most unique thing you have seen on your travels?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:31:46.659000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878315387366826015","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she tilts her head, curious to listen to the answer.","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:32:06.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878315469646483527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Hmmm\" she thinks for moment \"When I was heading to France a little over a year ago, I was traveling with a group of other sea elves  and triton, we found an abandoned underwater city. It was odd, the architecture wasn't something you'd normally see underwater. There was a large banner that said the City of Mantapolis.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:37:33.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878316843570446396","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"We couldn't tell why it was abandoned, but we also didn't get to explore it too much.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:38:01.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878316958276268062","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Oh that place is where we found Mello... how exciting\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T16:38:03.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878316968787181599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
